# Validation — dashboard validation list — 2026-10-22

## Defect and TDD
- Live `/api/status` returned `validations: []` while the active task had 102 eligible validation/review artifacts.
- Regression test initially failed at `status.validations.length > 0` before the fix.
- Cause: `collectValidationFiles` called `classifyReview` without importing it; its catch returned an empty list. Import added in `.harness/dashboard-server.mjs`.
- Initial test also pinned current task artifact names. Independent GPT-6 Luna round 1 returned `REMEDIATION_REQUIRED` with one P3 durability caveat. Test was changed to copy dashboard modules into a temporary repository and create synthetic task, validation, and review fixtures. It now asserts API exposes fixture `PASS` and `APPROVE` records without relying on the active task or its ten newest artifacts.

